もなく寒いですね～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はアメブロでも書いた通り\n今日も毛布に包まって\nぬくぬく生活しています(=ﾟωﾟ)ﾉ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/12/15/0934633/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2013年も遂にあと半月"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/12/15/0934633/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"風邪などをひかないように\n体調に気をつけて\n今年もラストスパートを\n駆け抜けましょーね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/12/15/0934633/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/12/15/0934633/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/12/15/0934633/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国握手会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"12月8日は全国握手会でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かりん琴子と3人グループ\nだったのですが、\n初めましてさんが多かった\n気がします*\\(^o^)/*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりの握手会で少し緊張\nしましたが、\nとっても楽しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/12/15/0934633/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"17レーンに来てくれた方々\nありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/ken